</node>
<node id="&quot;HOSPITAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The healthcare organization where the patient was admitted, hospitalized, and under the care of the vascular surgery team."&lt;SEP&gt;"The overarching facility providing medical services where the patient received care across multiple units like ICUs and general medicine."</data>
