</node>
<node id="&quot;CELLULITIS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The initial infectious event involving the right lower extremity that prompted empiric antibiotic coverage and admission."&lt;SEP&gt;"The medical event of right pedal cellulitis in the patient's history."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d5608bdb3aa5a25b6c0f796f152462c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01a8df0641b60633d561ef3970a93bd8</data>
