</node>
<node id="&quot;THE PATIENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The central individual admitted to the hospital with acute renal failure, hypotension, and suspected urosepsis, who underwent resuscitation and various treatments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The patient is the central subject of the medical record, suffering from multiple conditions including cardiorespiratory arrest, myocardial infarction, and acute renal failure during hospitalization."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d5608bdb3aa5a25b6c0f796f152462c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87d9cef9bf2900e79467061ad5003a41</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VASCULAR INTENSIVE CARE UNIT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The initial department where the patient was admitted due to hypotension, decreased urine output, and acute renal failure."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d5608bdb3aa5a25b6c0f796f152462c2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MEDICAL INTENSIVE CARE UNIT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The unit where the patient was boarded on the night of admission, experiencing a cardiorespiratory arrest and subsequent resuscitation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d5608bdb3aa5a25b6c0f796f152462c2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INFECTIOUS DISEASE SERVICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The department responsible for modifying the patient's antibiotic treatment regimen based on culture results."&lt;SEP&gt;"The infectious disease service is the organization that provided guidance on antibiotic discontinuation and management."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d5608bdb3aa5a25b6c0f796f152462c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87d9cef9bf2900e79467061ad5003a41</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GENERAL MEDICINE SERVICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The service to which the patient was transferred from the ICU before discharge to rehabilitation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d5608bdb3aa5a25b6c0f796f152462c2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CARDIORESPIRATORY ARREST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A critical emergency event where the patient stopped breathing and circulating, requiring epinephrine and cardioversion."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cardiorespiratory arrest is a critical event listed as a discharge diagnosis."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d5608bdb3aa5a25b6c0f796f152462c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87d9cef9bf2900e79467061ad5003a41</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FAMILY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The patient's family members who participated in discussions regarding advance directives and aggressive resuscitation decisions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d5608bdb3aa5a25b6c0f796f152462c2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DISCHARGE TO REHABILITATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The culmination of the hospital course where the patient was transferred out of the hospital to a rehabilitation facility."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d5608bdb3aa5a25b6c0f796f152462c2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REHABILITATION CENTER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The external organization where the patient was discharged to for continued recovery after stabilization."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d5608bdb3aa5a25b6c0f796f152462c2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHEST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Anatomical region of the body imaged via x-ray to demonstrate stable appearance of the pulmonary artery."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d5608bdb3aa5a25b6c0f796f152462c2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ABDOMINAL AORTA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Vascular structure in the abdomen imaged via CT where calcifications and aneurysm risk were assessed."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d5608bdb3aa5a25b6c0f796f152462c2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROSTATE GLAND&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Anatomical structure in the pelvic region noted to be enlarged and partially calcified during abdominal imaging."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d5608bdb3aa5a25b6c0f796f152462c2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESUSCITATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The emergency event following cardiorespiratory arrest where the patient received epinephrine and cardioversion."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d5608bdb3aa5a25b6c0f796f152462c2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CARDIAC CATHETERIZATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The planned invasive diagnostic procedure considered for the patient due to elevated troponin and non-q-wave myocardial infarction."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d5608bdb3aa5a25b6c0f796f152462c2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INTUBATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Intubation was an emergency procedure performed for respiratory support during severe illness."&lt;SEP&gt;"The procedure performed to protect the patient's airway following the cardiorespiratory arrest."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d5608bdb3aa5a25b6c0f796f152462c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87d9cef9bf2900e79467061ad5003a41</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UROSEPSIS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The suspected infectious event causing hypotension and renal failure, later confirmed or negated by culture results."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d5608bdb3aa5a25b6c0f796f152462c2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MEDQUIST36&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Medquist36 is a medical professional identifier associated with dictating the clinical record."&lt;SEP&gt;"Medquist36 is the medical professional (m.d.) who dictated the clinical record and oversees the documented procedures and diagnoses."&lt;SEP&gt;"Medquist36 is the professional who dictated the discharge summary note."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ed4025798a84b701fca6f5fd1e1780dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87d9cef9bf2900e79467061ad5003a41</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MYOCARDIAL INFARCTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Myocardial infarction is a cardiac event that occurred, specifically non-Q-wave."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-87d9cef9bf2900e79467061ad5003a41</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ACUTE RENAL FAILURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Acute renal failure and prerenal azotemia presented at admission and resolved following fluid resuscitation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Acute renal failure was a medical event presented by the patient that rapidly resolved."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-87d9cef9bf2900e79467061ad5003a41</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HOSPITALIZATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Hospitalization represents the duration of the patient's stay from admission to discharge."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-87d9cef9bf2900e79467061ad5003a41</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VENOUS CATHETERIZATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Venous catheterization is a medical procedure performed on the patient as part of the clinical care."&lt;SEP&gt;"Venous catheterization is a procedure performed during the patient's admission."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ed4025798a84b701fca6f5fd1e1780dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87d9cef9bf2900e79467061ad5003a41</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MECHANICAL VENTILATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Mechanical ventilation was an intervention used for 96 consecutive hours or more."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mechanical ventilation was used for 96 consecutive hours or more during the patient's hospitalization."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-87d9cef9bf2900e79467061ad5003a41</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INTRAVENOUS FLUIDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Intravenous fluids were administered for hydration as part of the patient's aggressive fluid resuscitation therapy."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-87d9cef9bf2900e79467061ad5003a41</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEVOFLOXACIN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Levofloxacin was a medication discontinued during the patient's hospitalization due to yeast growth in urine cultures."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-87d9cef9bf2900e79467061ad5003a41</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;METRONIDAZOLE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Metronidazole was a medication that was discontinued as part of antibiotic management."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-87d9cef9bf2900e79467061ad5003a41</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FLUCONAZOLE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fluconazole was prescribed for yeast infection treatment and was discontinued on hospital day five."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-87d9cef9bf2900e79467061ad5003a41</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GENTAMICIN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Gentamicin was an antibiotic that was discontinued on hospital day three during treatment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-87d9cef9bf2900e79467061ad5003a41</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VANCOMYCIN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Vancomycin was an antibiotic that was discontinued during the patient's hospitalization."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-87d9cef9bf2900e79467061ad5003a41</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PIPERACILLIN/TAZOBACTAM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Piperacillin/tazobactam was an antibiotic that was discontinued during treatment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-87d9cef9bf2900e79467061ad5003a41</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AMIODARONE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Amiodarone was a discharge medication prescribed at 400 mg twice daily for cardiac management."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-87d9cef9bf2900e79467061ad5003a41</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;METOPROLOL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Metoprolol was a discharge medication prescribed at 50 mg twice daily for cardiac management."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-87d9cef9bf2900e79467061ad5003a41</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CAPTOPRIL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Captopril was a discharge medication prescribed at 6.25 mg three times daily for blood pressure management."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-87d9cef9bf2900e79467061ad5003a41</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ASPIRIN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Aspirin was a discharge medication prescribed at 325 mg once daily for cardiovascular protection."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-87d9cef9bf2900e79467061ad5003a41</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PANTOPRAZOLE&quot;">
